WEBVTT

00:11.330 --> 00:14.250
<b>TODAY'S EVENTS</b>

00:11.330 --> 00:14.250
<b>MAIN HALL:</b>

00:11.340 --> 00:14.250
<b>SPECIAL FINE ARTS</b>

00:11.340 --> 00:14.250
<b>PERFORMANCE  FOR</b>

00:11.340 --> 00:14.250
<b>STUDENTS OF</b>

00:11.340 --> 00:14.250
<b>MODORIKAWA</b>

00:11.340 --> 00:14.250
<b>HIGH SCHOOL</b>

00:17.380 --> 00:22.330
<b>This is pretty exciting! I can't believe we get
to watch a play instead of having regular class.</b>

00:22.920 --> 00:24.080
<b>Yeah, totally...</b>

00:24.540 --> 00:27.080
<b>Are you okay, Miyaka-chan? You seem down.</b>

00:28.790 --> 00:30.540
<b>Just tired from a lack of sleep.</b>

00:30.540 --> 00:31.380
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

00:31.920 --> 00:33.750
<b>What play are we seeing?</b>

00:33.960 --> 00:35.130
<b>"Harlot in the Rain."</b>

00:35.540 --> 00:40.290
<b>It's based on the memoirs of a harlot from the Edo-period
and tells the story of how she fell in love with a samurai.</b>

00:40.630 --> 00:41.710
<b>What's a "harlot"?</b>

00:41.880 --> 00:44.330
<b>PERFORMANCE ON: MAY 8TH (FRIDAY)</b>

00:41.880 --> 00:44.330
<b>STARTING AT 2 PM</b>

00:42.540 --> 00:45.000
<b>Kinda like a prostitute? That's what I heard, anyway.</b>

00:45.580 --> 00:48.210
<b>Apparently, even daughters
from affluent warrior and merchant families</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.420
<b>ended up doing work like that
due to problems with their parents.</b>

00:50.330 --> 00:56.380
<b>HARLOT</b>

00:50.330 --> 00:56.380
<b>IN THE</b>

00:50.340 --> 00:56.380
<b>RAIN</b>

00:51.670 --> 00:54.250
<b>So is that why this one was able to write a memoir?</b>

00:54.790 --> 00:56.250
<b>You sure know your stuff, Kaoru-chan.</b>

00:57.290 --> 00:59.040
<b>I got all the deets from him.</b>

00:59.670 --> 01:00.630
<b>Wait, do you mean...?</b>

01:04.920 --> 01:11.710
<b>Without further ado, the Kukami Troupe is proud
to present their performance of "Harlot in the Rain."</b>

01:20.130 --> 01:25.210
<b>"Come, girl. Tell me your name."
The warrior meant to be her future husband asked.</b>

01:25.330 --> 01:31.630
<b>Their marriage was merely a way for her struggling family
to escape ruin, making women like her nothing but tools.</b>

01:32.000 --> 01:33.920
<b>"I am the daughter of the samurai class, sir!"</b>

01:34.040 --> 01:38.420
<b>This aloof reply surely upset him,
for it was akin to insulting his intelligence.</b>

01:38.670 --> 01:43.790
<b>Thus the marriage talks were scrapped, and with
no other avenues left, their family was brought to ruin.</b>

01:44.630 --> 01:49.710
<b>Her father was consumed by despair and died,
while her mother just hurled endless spite.</b>

01:51.170 --> 01:52.670
<b>But no matter.</b>

01:52.920 --> 01:56.920
<b>Their relationship was never one of passion
or affection in the first place.</b>

01:57.420 --> 02:01.080
<b>And just like that, no one remained
to call the girl by her name.</b>

02:03.170 --> 02:09.000
<b>But damned if she had any regrets.
She had already surmised this harsh reality long ago.</b>

02:10.460 --> 02:12.290
<b>There was no need for her to have a name.</b>

02:32.210 --> 02:34.330
<b>Good grief! What awful weather.</b>

02:36.210 --> 02:38.920
<b>You can say that again. I'm drenched.</b>

02:45.750 --> 02:48.380
<b>Taking cover from the rain here, too, Mister Samurai?</b>

04:45.540 --> 04:48.670
<b>First time seeing a woman who sells her body, or what?</b>

04:49.580 --> 04:53.330
<b>Oh, my apologies! I didn't mean to offend you!</b>

04:53.330 --> 04:54.210
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

04:57.500 --> 05:01.290
<b>People often say I'm too serious
and formal for my own good.</b>

05:01.500 --> 05:06.250
<b>Well, I'd say anybody who acts so ceremonial
with prostitutes is definitely on the weird side.</b>

05:06.420 --> 05:08.000
<b>Is that so?</b>

05:08.210 --> 05:09.880
<b>Yes, it is.</b>

05:10.330 --> 05:11.330
<b>Oh...</b>

05:18.750 --> 05:21.170
<b>Doesn't seem like it'll let up any time soon.</b>

05:21.830 --> 05:23.960
<b>You mustn't! You'll get wet!</b>

05:23.960 --> 05:27.080
<b>I already am. Farewell, Mister Samurai.</b>

05:27.250 --> 05:29.710
<b>H-hold on! Don't go yet!</b>

05:31.130 --> 05:32.960
<b>Uh, let me introduce myself!</b>

05:33.250 --> 05:37.790
<b>I am Naotsugu Miura. May I please have your name?</b>

05:38.710 --> 05:39.630
<b>Harlot.</b>

05:40.170 --> 05:42.420
<b>I'm just Harlot the harlot.</b>

05:42.750 --> 05:45.750
<b>Names don't need to be
any more complicated than that, right?</b>

05:46.630 --> 05:50.330
<b>Her pale skin. Her glistening, raven locks.</b>

05:50.500 --> 05:55.330
<b>And her smile like a light mist that evaporated
into the night. She looked almost otherworldly.</b>

05:55.710 --> 05:59.040
<b>This was the first time that Naotsugu
had ever been captivated by a woman.</b>

05:59.040 --> 06:03.080
<b>Overcome by a sudden fit of shyness,
he looked away ever so briefly,</b>

06:03.380 --> 06:05.040
<b>and that's when he noticed.</b>

06:06.580 --> 06:07.330
<b>Wait, that's...</b>

06:10.500 --> 06:12.080
<b>...my brother?</b>

06:12.170 --> 06:13.080
<b>Oh...</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:15.790
<b>It's really him.</b>

06:17.210 --> 06:19.210
<b>Do you know who that man is?!</b>

06:20.540 --> 06:22.080
<b>An old fame.</b>

06:24.710 --> 06:30.210
<b>The year was 1855. It was a night
where a heavy rain covered everything in sight</b>

06:30.210 --> 06:31.960
<b>in the flourish town of Asakusa.</b>

06:34.670 --> 06:37.580
<b>Oh, welcome in, Miura-sama.</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:38.330
<b>Greetings.</b>

06:41.250 --> 06:42.670
<b>Ah, Jin-dono!</b>

06:50.130 --> 06:52.420
<b>Things got really bad after we parted last night.</b>

06:52.670 --> 06:53.380
<b>Huh?</b>

06:53.630 --> 06:54.500
<b>The rain.</b>

06:54.830 --> 06:57.080
<b>Ah! Yes, just awful.</b>

06:59.250 --> 07:00.170
<b>Kake-soba, please.</b>

07:00.170 --> 07:02.250
<b>Okay. One bowl of kake!</b>

07:02.250 --> 07:03.170
<b>Comin' up!</b>

07:03.460 --> 07:05.330
<b>You two were together last night?</b>

07:05.330 --> 07:10.420
<b>Jin-dono and I went out with Zenji-dono from Sugaya
for some drinks at a little bar in Asakusa.</b>

07:10.710 --> 07:12.290
<b>My, how nice!</b>

07:12.670 --> 07:18.130
<b>Except Jin-dono here was like a bottomless pit,
and I end up drinking too much by following his lead.</b>

07:18.580 --> 07:21.380
<b>Oh dear. Take it easy on him, Jinya-kun.</b>

07:21.670 --> 07:23.880
<b>I don't recall putting any pressure on you.</b>

07:24.210 --> 07:26.420
<b>Anyways, it was a fun time!</b>

07:26.710 --> 07:31.000
<b>But after we left in such high spirits,
that awful rainstorm hit...</b>

07:31.080 --> 07:31.630
<b>Huh?</b>

07:31.630 --> 07:33.330
<b>Kake-soba, order up!</b>

07:33.540 --> 07:34.330
<b>Coming!</b>

07:34.920 --> 07:39.380
<b>What about you, Jin-dono? I recall you
mentioning going to look for a job after that.</b>

07:39.580 --> 07:42.290
<b>Yes. I caught wind of an interesting rumor.</b>

07:43.500 --> 07:45.130
<b>Demons, I assume?</b>

07:45.630 --> 07:50.210
<b>Very likely. I'm actually going back
to Asakusa again tonight.</b>

07:51.130 --> 07:52.040
<b>Asakusa...</b>

07:54.040 --> 07:55.920
<b>As the sun dipped below the horizon,</b>

07:56.670 --> 08:00.380
<b>Naotsugu departed on a lone trip to Asakusa once again.</b>

08:00.580 --> 08:03.170
<b>He stood under the same eaves as the night before,</b>

08:03.170 --> 08:08.960
<b>his heart filled with uncertainty as he waited
for who knows what.</b>

08:12.250 --> 08:14.250
<b>Sheltering from the rain in spite of your umbrella?</b>

08:15.040 --> 08:16.080
<b>Harlot-dono.</b>

08:16.460 --> 08:19.500
<b>"Harlot-dono"? What a strange way to refer to me.</b>

08:19.630 --> 08:21.290
<b>But that's what you said your name was...</b>

08:21.710 --> 08:22.880
<b>Fair point.</b>

08:27.830 --> 08:30.290
<b>What brings you here, Mister Samurai?</b>

08:30.540 --> 08:32.670
<b>You may call me Naotsugu.</b>

08:32.670 --> 08:33.460
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

08:34.290 --> 08:36.920
<b>So, why are you here, Mister Samurai?</b>

08:38.080 --> 08:41.080
<b>Well, you could say that my interest was piqued.</b>

08:41.500 --> 08:43.880
<b>You know, by that silhouette we saw last night.</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:46.540
<b>It's like I told you. He's an old flame.</b>

08:47.460 --> 08:49.830
<b>Which means that you and he, uh...</b>

08:50.040 --> 08:55.380
<b>Careful now. It's best not to dig into a woman's history,
even more so if she's a prostitute.</b>

08:56.500 --> 08:57.580
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:58.790 --> 09:02.130
<b>Jeez. You really are honest to a fault.</b>

09:02.130 --> 09:02.790
<b>No.</b>

09:04.420 --> 09:05.330
<b>Because actually...</b>

09:06.460 --> 09:08.420
<b>I came here for you.</b>

09:08.960 --> 09:12.170
<b>Really now? Then you should've just said
you wanted to buy me.</b>

09:12.170 --> 09:15.790
<b>That's not what I mean!
All I wanted was to see you once more.</b>

09:16.750 --> 09:20.080
<b>My bad. I was only joking with you.</b>

09:21.420 --> 09:22.630
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

09:23.130 --> 09:25.500
<b>You really are a strange one.</b>

09:38.130 --> 09:39.170
<b>I knew it...</b>

09:40.130 --> 09:42.880
<b>The shadowy figure merely stood there.</b>

09:42.880 --> 09:46.460
<b>But the shape of its face was one
that Naotsugu could never forget.</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:48.210
<b>Brother...</b>

09:48.710 --> 09:49.710
<b>Why now?</b>

09:49.790 --> 09:50.330
<b>Huh?</b>

09:50.830 --> 09:53.040
<b>Why show up after all this time?</b>

09:54.080 --> 09:55.420
<b>"An old flame."</b>

09:56.040 --> 09:59.960
<b>It seemed those words might refer
to someone other than just a former customer.</b>

09:59.960 --> 10:06.330
<b>As if to prove this, her voice rung through the air
with affection so deep it could not be hidden.</b>

10:06.920 --> 10:09.830
<b>And yet, her svelte shoulders were trembling.</b>

10:10.880 --> 10:13.250
<b>She was... frightened.</b>

10:23.630 --> 10:26.750
<b>Jinya-kun. Is something bothering you?</b>

10:27.420 --> 10:29.500
<b>I botched a job last night.</b>

10:30.130 --> 10:33.130
<b>I had the demon in my sights, but I failed to finish it off.</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:34.290
<b>Oh dear.</b>

10:34.500 --> 10:36.080
<b>I'm disappointed in myself.</b>

10:36.630 --> 10:39.080
<b>Does that mean you're going hunting again tonight?</b>

10:39.670 --> 10:43.920
<b>The demon apparently only comes out when it rains,
so that depends on the weather.</b>

10:43.920 --> 10:44.750
<b>Jin-dono!</b>

10:45.130 --> 10:46.460
<b>Welcome in.</b>

10:52.380 --> 10:53.170
<b>Jin-dono...</b>

10:53.290 --> 10:57.250
<b>Actually, I would like for all of you to hear me out.</b>

10:57.250 --> 10:58.710
<b>Even us?</b>

10:59.210 --> 11:01.040
<b>I would appreciate your advice.</b>

11:04.460 --> 11:07.290
<b>You see, the thing is... um...</b>

11:07.580 --> 11:09.130
<b>I've taken an interest in a woman.</b>

11:09.540 --> 11:11.750
<b>Hello! Two bowls of kake, please.</b>

11:16.580 --> 11:17.920
<b>Why's everybody so quiet?</b>

11:19.710 --> 11:20.920
<b>Well, now!</b>

11:21.130 --> 11:23.790
<b>Harlot the harlot, eh?</b>

11:23.790 --> 11:26.170
<b>Seems you had quite the night
after we finished drinking the other day.</b>

11:26.250 --> 11:30.080
<b>Unlike a certain somebody who couldn't resist
a jaunt through the redlight district.</b>

11:30.080 --> 11:32.830
<b>Uh, let's stay focused on Naotsugu's story, okay, milady?</b>

11:32.830 --> 11:37.790
<b>A-anyways, the point is that you want our advice
on how to win this lady's heart.</b>

11:38.040 --> 11:39.170
<b>Do I have that right?</b>

11:39.500 --> 11:42.790
<b>Well, I can't deny that I'm smitten with her.</b>

11:42.790 --> 11:44.750
<b>Hoo-boy! Things are getting spicy!</b>

11:45.330 --> 11:47.080
<b>So you're genuinely interested?</b>

11:47.290 --> 11:51.290
<b>Absolutely. I really want
to learn more about her as a person.</b>

11:51.290 --> 11:54.580
<b>But you're on opposite ends of the social ladder.
What good will that do you?</b>

11:55.210 --> 11:56.830
<b>I'll cross that bridge when I come to it.</b>

11:57.500 --> 12:00.750
<b>Gosh, you're more of a romantic than I thought.</b>

12:01.130 --> 12:05.170
<b>I see how it is. Okay, then it's time
for one of my ingenious plans!</b>

12:05.460 --> 12:09.580
<b>We'll stage it so that this harlot can see Naotsugu
in a good light, then she'll totally fall for him.</b>

12:09.580 --> 12:11.080
<b>How will that work?</b>

12:11.170 --> 12:14.880
<b>When she's out trying to attract customers
for the night... bam!</b>

12:14.880 --> 12:17.830
<b>A bandit attacks her! And she goes, "Eeek!"</b>

12:16.920 --> 12:17.830
<b>No way.</b>

12:18.250 --> 12:20.210
<b>Then the gallant Naotsugu appears!</b>

12:20.210 --> 12:24.580
<b>He unsheathes his blade of cold steel,
bringing the villain down in one swift stroke!</b>

12:24.580 --> 12:25.750
<b>I said, no!</b>

12:26.210 --> 12:27.170
<b>But, milady...</b>

12:27.290 --> 12:29.750
<b>Dull. Cliché. Outdated!</b>

12:29.920 --> 12:32.540
<b>Besides, I doubt a bandit would show up
with such good timing.</b>

12:33.250 --> 12:34.880
<b>That's where you come in, bandito.</b>

12:35.210 --> 12:36.170
<b>Impossible.</b>

12:36.170 --> 12:39.210
<b>I agree. Especially for these two.</b>

12:39.790 --> 12:42.750
<b>Hrmm. I thought it was a good idea.</b>

12:42.750 --> 12:45.380
<b>C'mon, you should help us out here, pops!</b>

12:46.080 --> 12:48.210
<b>Huh? Well, if you ask me...</b>

12:48.210 --> 12:50.710
<b>More interaction should be your first order of business.</b>

12:50.960 --> 12:53.380
<b>Interaction, you say?</b>

12:53.790 --> 13:00.040
<b>If you want to win someone's heart, then you have to
put in the time and effort. Get to know them personally.</b>

13:00.630 --> 13:05.540
<b>And more importantly, let them learn all about you.</b>

13:05.750 --> 13:13.170
<b>I can't guarantee that it will work out in the end,
but there are never any shortcuts to fostering true love.</b>

13:13.670 --> 13:20.040
<b>By the way, I spent upwards of 20 years doing that
myself, and actually won over the world's best woman.</b>

13:25.330 --> 13:26.630
<b>I see.</b>

13:26.960 --> 13:30.750
<b>Good point. I think you're right, sir.</b>

13:33.080 --> 13:36.040
<b>I will wait for her under the same eaves again tonight.</b>

13:36.420 --> 13:38.960
<b>Thank you, everyone.</b>

13:46.880 --> 13:48.500
<b>He really took that to heart.</b>

13:48.670 --> 13:50.920
<b>I'm seeing you in a new light, pops!</b>

13:51.210 --> 13:53.670
<b>The older, the wiser. As they say.</b>

13:55.250 --> 13:58.670
<b>What's wrong, Ofuu? Did I say something to upset you?</b>

13:58.670 --> 14:04.210
<b>Nothing like that. I just found something
a little strange about Miura-sama's story.</b>

14:04.420 --> 14:05.290
<b>Strange?</b>

14:06.000 --> 14:11.960
<b>Miura-sama and Harlot-san met two nights ago
when they both took cover from the rain, right?</b>

14:12.710 --> 14:14.170
<b>That's what he said.</b>

14:14.460 --> 14:16.580
<b>And then, Jinya-kun...</b>

14:16.750 --> 14:21.080
<b>You said a demon that only appears in the rain
escaped from you last night.</b>

14:21.080 --> 14:22.210
<b>That's right.</b>

14:24.210 --> 14:27.880
<b>The only problem is,
it didn't rain yesterday or the day before.</b>

14:30.170 --> 14:34.540
<b>There is a limit to the breadth of knowledge
that people can possess.</b>

14:35.130 --> 14:38.170
<b>People can only see things that are perceivable.</b>

14:38.500 --> 14:44.500
<b>Which means so long as we are alive,
all we can truly know is our own story.</b>

14:44.500 --> 14:45.380
<b>However...</b>

14:46.250 --> 14:49.330
<b>"Unseen" does not equal "nonexistent."</b>

14:49.750 --> 14:53.000
<b>We must always keep in mind
there are a subset of things</b>

14:53.000 --> 14:55.710
<b>that exist in the world even though nobody can see them.</b>

14:58.040 --> 15:02.580
<b>A sudden downpour hits.
And the same eaves as yesterday serve as cover.</b>

15:02.960 --> 15:05.380
<b>Although Harlot meant no hostility,</b>

15:05.460 --> 15:10.000
<b>the words that inadvertently spilled from her mouth
seemed to ring with a certain truth.</b>

15:13.960 --> 15:16.290
<b>Figures he wouldn't be here today.</b>

15:16.960 --> 15:22.500
<b>The penetrating cold of the night was undeterred by
the spring season, drudging up memories of long ago.</b>

15:23.460 --> 15:27.830
<b>She had stooped to becoming a prostitute
in spite of her birth as a member of samurai nobility,</b>

15:28.040 --> 15:31.420
<b>but she wasn't attached to her former life
enough to have any misgivings.</b>

15:31.540 --> 15:38.960
<b>Perhaps for one exception. The sole person in her family
who had actually treated her right: her older brother.</b>

15:39.670 --> 15:43.670
<b>He had once scraped together enough money
to buy her a cuckoo kanzashi,</b>

15:44.250 --> 15:47.880
<b>but she had no idea where it was now.</b>

15:52.920 --> 15:53.710
<b>Ki...</b>

16:09.250 --> 16:10.880
<b>This way...</b>

16:11.040 --> 16:13.210
<b>She heard his voice calling to her.</b>

16:13.750 --> 16:16.460
<b>But no. That should have been impossible.</b>

16:16.460 --> 16:20.040
<b>Because... he was already long gone.</b>

16:43.250 --> 16:44.830
<b>Dear brother...</b>

16:47.790 --> 16:50.250
<b>You mustn't go! Harlot-dono!</b>

16:50.830 --> 16:52.170
<b>Mister Samurai?</b>

16:52.170 --> 16:54.420
<b>Get a hold of yourself, Harlot-dono!</b>

16:54.960 --> 16:58.960
<b>Please, you must let me go. He's calling for me.</b>

16:59.330 --> 17:01.000
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

17:01.460 --> 17:03.210
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

17:03.580 --> 17:07.250
<b>There's no way he could be here. Not in this place.</b>

17:07.750 --> 17:08.420
<b>But still...</b>

17:08.420 --> 17:12.080
<b>Snap out of it! You must realize it's not human!</b>

17:12.080 --> 17:14.170
<b>No, I know him!</b>

17:14.460 --> 17:15.960
<b>Your old flame.</b>

17:16.170 --> 17:18.830
<b>A person who you care deeply for even now.</b>

17:19.080 --> 17:21.380
<b>That's obvious enough for me to figure out.</b>

17:21.670 --> 17:23.460
<b>But you're being tricked!</b>

17:23.880 --> 17:26.380
<b>There are paranormal forces at work here.</b>

17:26.920 --> 17:28.670
<b>That thing is... a demon!</b>

17:30.670 --> 17:32.380
<b>What are you doing, Mister Samurai?!</b>

17:34.580 --> 17:41.130
<b>Abide by morals, exemplify courage, practice
compassion, behave with courtesy, and remain devoted.</b>

17:41.290 --> 17:44.170
<b>Be like a sword and slay the enemy before you!</b>

17:45.830 --> 17:49.080
<b>Harlot-dono. I am a samurai.</b>

17:49.290 --> 17:54.290
<b>And I swear to you upon my blade,
that thing is not the precious person you seek.</b>

17:54.630 --> 17:57.580
<b>You must believe me. Please!</b>

18:59.290 --> 19:00.330
<b>Jin-dono!</b>

19:15.330 --> 19:17.130
<b>Are you okay, Mister Samurai?</b>

19:17.130 --> 19:19.250
<b>Yes. And you, Harlot-dono?</b>

19:19.250 --> 19:21.000
<b>I'm doing just fine.</b>

19:21.000 --> 19:24.210
<b>You're a lot tougher than you look.
I'm honestly surprised.</b>

19:24.210 --> 19:24.880
<b>Huh?</b>

19:24.880 --> 19:26.540
<b>Don't you agree, ronin?</b>

19:27.670 --> 19:28.210
<b>Yes.</b>

19:29.170 --> 19:30.630
<b>No, I didn't actually...</b>

19:35.380 --> 19:39.830
<b>You had me worried when yours hands started shaking
like a leaf after drawing your katana.</b>

19:40.040 --> 19:43.000
<b>That was an intimidation tactic he used
to show the demon he meant business.</b>

19:43.130 --> 19:45.750
<b>Hold on, do you two know each other?</b>

19:46.290 --> 19:47.460
<b>Yeah, sorta.</b>

19:47.710 --> 19:50.000
<b>Do you mean, like, as a customer?</b>

19:50.130 --> 19:53.380
<b>Yeah, but I'm the customer. I've hired him before.</b>

19:53.710 --> 19:54.960
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

19:55.330 --> 19:59.420
<b>So, that dark shadow was a demon after all?</b>

20:00.460 --> 20:03.460
<b>More like feelings of regret
that weren't able to fully manifest as a demon.</b>

20:03.670 --> 20:04.460
<b>Regret?</b>

20:06.460 --> 20:11.920
<b>The dead often have unfinished business in this world
and their regret can amass into a physical form.</b>

20:12.460 --> 20:18.380
<b>However, that one was incomplete. So it merely
reflected the regrets of those who gazed upon it, instead.</b>

20:19.540 --> 20:22.790
<b>To me it looked like my brother, Sadanaga.</b>

20:23.380 --> 20:28.880
<b>However, when I began to fear that Harlot-dono
may get abducted, it turned into a mere shadow.</b>

20:30.670 --> 20:32.250
<b>Regret, eh?</b>

20:32.790 --> 20:35.710
<b>I thought I'd made a clean break with my past.</b>

20:37.040 --> 20:41.130
<b>Even so... there are some things we can never let go of.</b>

20:44.250 --> 20:46.710
<b>Miyaka-chan. Miyaka-chan!</b>

20:47.920 --> 20:49.330
<b>Hi, sleepyhead.</b>

20:52.290 --> 20:53.040
<b>Huh?</b>

20:56.580 --> 20:58.380
<b>Crap, I fell asleep...</b>

21:05.170 --> 21:05.960
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:05.960 --> 21:09.420
<b>You meanie. How could you let me sleep
through the whole thing?</b>

21:09.880 --> 21:14.210
<b>Hey, I tried to wake you up a bunch of times.
Don't you remember?</b>

21:15.000 --> 21:16.250
<b>Not at all.</b>

21:17.170 --> 21:20.460
<b>Don't fret, I'll help you write your report about the play.</b>

21:40.290 --> 21:41.960
<b>Nice. Looks good to me!</b>

21:43.080 --> 21:44.830
<b>Thanks, Kaoru-chan!</b>

21:44.830 --> 21:46.380
<b>You're welcome.</b>

21:46.960 --> 21:50.790
<b>But it's a shame you missed out. That play was great.</b>

21:51.130 --> 21:53.380
<b>Hey! You agree with me, right?</b>

21:53.670 --> 21:56.290
<b>Oh, Asagao... I mean, Azusaya.</b>

21:56.290 --> 21:59.330
<b>I wish you'd remember my name already!</b>

21:59.750 --> 22:03.000
<b>Sorry. It's not really a memory problem.</b>

22:03.130 --> 22:04.290
<b>I just can't help it.</b>

22:04.290 --> 22:07.040
<b>Do I really look that much like your friend?</b>

22:07.130 --> 22:08.460
<b>Incredibly.</b>

22:09.210 --> 22:11.540
<b>She was just like a celestial maiden.</b>

22:11.540 --> 22:14.290
<b>There you go again with your weird comments!</b>

22:14.290 --> 22:17.000
<b>So, hey, was the play really that good?</b>

22:17.330 --> 22:18.290
<b>For the most part.</b>

22:19.170 --> 22:24.380
<b>I thought it was disrespectful how clumsy they made
Naotsugu's ronin friend out to be, though.</b>

22:24.580 --> 22:28.670
<b>It's funny because he rushed in to save them,
but it was Naotsugu who killed the demon in the end.</b>

22:28.880 --> 22:31.630
<b>I get the impression
that Harlot's memoirs were slanderous.</b>

22:32.790 --> 22:34.380
<b>You're blowing it out of proportion!</b>

22:34.540 --> 22:38.210
<b>Harlot was in love with Naotsugu,
so it's only natural she made him the hero.</b>

22:39.580 --> 22:41.710
<b>C'mon, there were plenty of good parts!</b>

22:41.920 --> 22:44.080
<b>Like the scene after Harlot married Naotsugu,</b>

22:44.080 --> 22:48.920
<b>where she was sitting with the ronin's daughter
and watching the two of them spar.</b>

22:49.290 --> 22:51.580
<b>Oh. That's right.</b>

22:51.790 --> 22:55.790
<b>It sticks out because even though
that's when Harlot realized the ronin was a demon,</b>

22:55.790 --> 22:57.460
<b>she pretended not to know, right?</b>

22:57.460 --> 22:59.210
<b>It's so heartwarming!</b>

22:59.380 --> 23:02.210
<b>Good grief, Harlot really pulled one over on me.</b>

23:02.210 --> 23:05.080
<b>She never once showed that side of herself openly.</b>

23:05.290 --> 23:06.130
<b>Right?</b>

23:06.130 --> 23:09.210
<b>You know, I'm really curious now!</b>

23:09.210 --> 23:11.380
<b>Crud! Why did I fall asleep?</b>

23:11.380 --> 23:16.130
<b>If you just want to experience the story, then it's available
in paperback. As part of a short story collection.</b>

23:16.380 --> 23:17.250
<b>Really?</b>

23:17.250 --> 23:19.420
<b>I think I'll look for a copy, too.</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:23.210
<b>Although I'd prefer to read
the original copy of Harlot's memoir.</b>

23:23.210 --> 23:25.250
<b>You're more interested in that?</b>

23:25.250 --> 23:28.130
<b>Mostly just to see how the ronin was portrayed.</b>

23:28.420 --> 23:31.330
<b>Hey, do you have a grudge against Harlot-san or what?</b>
